[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0010","text":"那、那个……\n奇、奇怪吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0020","text":"啊，怎么会奇怪呢\n非常合适哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0030","text":"是、是吗……\n嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0040","text":"拍张照片留作纪念吧\n来，看这边──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0050","text":"耶、耶……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0060","text":"这、这种衣服……\n第一次穿，好害羞……但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0070","text":"和小奈……还有千雪小姐……\n是配套的服装，所以……好开心……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0080","text":"啊，和甘奈、千雪\n还有甜花一起，开始ALSTROEMERIA"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0090","text":"嘿嘿……是啊……\n甜花是……ALSTROEMERIA……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500100_03_0100","text":"ALSTROEMERIA的……\n大崎甜花……！"}]
